  tip 36 Rough Stone for Engineering 1-75: 36 Rough Blasting Powder. Mining: Copper Vein (skill 1) in Dun Morogh (1-10), Elwynn Forest (1-10) and Zephras Isle (1-15). The arrow takes the Mining loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left. Or buy them at the Auction House.
