step Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs to 245 · Professions tab (K by default)
  tip Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs is yellow at 225 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 62 crafts to 245, up to 79 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Mithril Bar and 1 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Make the 9 Solid Blasting Powder first. Use the 53 Solid Blasting Powder you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One Mithril Bar and one Solid Blasting Powder a craft; hunters buy the slugs. The slow part: the slugs turn green at 230, so 225-245 takes about 60 crafts for 20 points. Nothing in the data is cheaper here (Mithril Casing takes three times the Mithril; the rest need Truesilver or parts). Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning Solid Blasting Powder and Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs, learn them now: an earlier step teaches them.
